&lt;p&gt;Class: Thaumiel&lt;br /&gt;
Codename: The Chorus&lt;br /&gt;
designation: Scp 5934&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scp 5934 Should be contained in a 4x4x4 meter containment area. Scp 5934 should be allowed to move about the facility between the time of 6 AM to 7 PM and should be placed into it&#039;s holding cell outside of this time frame. if any Scp&#039;s breach containment, Scp 5934 should be moved to the area of the Scp that has breached containment. Scp 5934 is a group of glowing orbs that can change colour at any time. When Scp 5934 is exposed to any living entity, it will begin to sing in a voice that has been described as &amp;quot;Enchanting&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Otherworldly&amp;quot;. this song will produce a calm in any exposed entity. this has been used in containing multiple containment breaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krazykommando&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7081197&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607955388&quot; alt=&quot;KrazyKommando&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7081197)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/krazykommando&quot;  &gt;KrazyKommando&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
